Order Windows Machine checks permissions?
• Account: The user or computer account.
• Global: Put the account into a Global Group (used to organize accounts based on business roles).
• DomainLocal: Put the Global Group into a Domain Local Group (used to grant specific resource permissions).
• Permissions: Assign the actual resource Permissions (like Read or Modify) directly to the Domain Local Group.


